<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 15:19:41 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>超快电子和激光为更好的成像和传感技术带来了可能性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ultrafast-electrons-and-lasers-open-possibilities-for-better-imaging-and-sensing-technologies</link><description>SLAC 和斯坦福大学的科学家使用超快电子和激光揭示了对电离的意外强烈的光学响应，为放射成像和传感开辟了新的可能性，同时揭示了材料的基本行为。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ultrafast-electrons-and-lasers-open-possibilities-for-better-imaging-and-sensing-technologies2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 15:19:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ultrafast-electrons-and-lasers-open-possibilities-for-better-imaging-and-sensing-technologies</guid></item><item><title>随着芯片巨头Nvidia成为人工智能公司的主要支持者，其投资额增至990亿美元</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nvidias-investments-grow-to-99-billion-as-chip-giant-becomes-major-backer-of-ai-companies</link><description>Nvidia 报告称其持有 990 亿美元的股权，支持整个行业的人工智能实验室、云提供商和基础设施公司。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nvidias-investments-grow-to-99-billion-as-chip-giant-becomes-major-backer-of-ai-companies.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 15:04:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nvidias-investments-grow-to-99-billion-as-chip-giant-becomes-major-backer-of-ai-companies</guid></item><item><title>特斯拉在活动中推出 Cyber​​cab</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tesla-launches-cybercab-at-event</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 14:49:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tesla-launches-cybercab-at-event</guid></item><item><title>科学家绘制了与严重自闭症相关的关键蛋白质相互作用图</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-map-key-protein-interactions-linked-with-profound-autism</link><description>发表在《科学》杂志上的研究阐明了对深度自闭症的生物学理解中的“缺失部分”，并为药物开发提供了新的目标。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-map-key-protein-interactions-linked-with-profound-autism.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 14:34:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-map-key-protein-interactions-linked-with-profound-autism</guid></item><item><title>1973 年，前陆军潜水员埃里克·肖 (Eric Shaw) 开始在直布罗陀附近投放捐赠的船只； 30多艘船之后，沙质海底变成了鱼苗圃</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/in-1973-former-army-diver-eric-shaw-began-dropping-donated-boats-off-gibraltar-over-30-vessels-later-the-sandy-seabed-had-become-a-fish-nursery</link><description>1973 年，前陆军潜水员埃里克·肖 (Eric Shaw) 观察了直布罗陀的大部分沙质海底，发现了为海洋生物提供定居、隐藏和繁殖的地方的机会。他的解决方案很不寻常：使用不需要的船只建造人工鱼礁。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/in-1973-former-army-diver-eric-shaw-began-dropping-donated-boats-off-gibraltar-over-30-vessels-later-the-sandy-seabed-had-become-a-fish-nursery.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 14:19:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/in-1973-former-army-diver-eric-shaw-began-dropping-donated-boats-off-gibraltar-over-30-vessels-later-the-sandy-seabed-had-become-a-fish-nursery</guid></item><item><title>塞缪尔·巴特勒和技术奇点</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/samuel-butler-and-the-technological-singularity</link><description>1863 年，新西兰的一位养羊户写道，机器正在不断发展，这个过程不会停止，我们正忙着打造自己的继任者。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/samuel-butler-and-the-technological-singularity.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 14:04:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/samuel-butler-and-the-technological-singularity</guid></item><item><title>好奇号火星车发现巨大的多边形区域</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/mars-curiosity-rover-discovers-massive-field-of-polygons</link><description>火星表面拥有太阳系中一些最令人惊叹和令人惊叹的景观。这主要是因为这颗红色星球缺乏地球所拥有的几种表面重塑过程，包括板块构造、火山活动和流水。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mars-curiosity-rover-discovers-massive-field-of-polygons.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 13:49:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/mars-curiosity-rover-discovers-massive-field-of-polygons</guid></item><item><title>可扩展的半透明有机光伏模块可以将窗户变成发电机</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scalable-semitransparent-organic-pv-modules-could-turn-windows-into-power-generators</link><description>有机太阳能模块因其灵活性、透明度和特别良好的环境足迹而得分。尤其是与波长相关的透明度是有机光伏发电的主要优势&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scalable-semitransparent-organic-pv-modules-could-turn-windows-into-power-generators.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 13:34:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scalable-semitransparent-organic-pv-modules-could-turn-windows-into-power-generators</guid></item><item><title>“支持性”脑细胞可能会主动导致认知能力下降</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/supportive-brain-cells-may-actively-drive-cognitive-decline</link><description>最新研究表明，在神经纤维周围产生保护层的脑细胞会随着年龄的增长而变得功能失调，并可能导致认知能力下降。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/supportive-brain-cells-may-actively-drive-cognitive-decline2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 13:19:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/supportive-brain-cells-may-actively-drive-cognitive-decline</guid></item><item><title>边缘计算将 IIoT 延迟缩短 87%：制造商为何在 2026 年将数据移出云端</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/edge-computing-cuts-iiot-latency-by-87-why-manufacturers-move-data-off-cloud-in-2026</link><description>边缘计算将 IIoT 延迟缩短了 87%，将数据移出云端。 10–30 毫秒的响应时间可降低成本并保持工厂正常运行。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/edge-computing-cuts-iiot-latency-by-87-why-manufacturers-move-data-off-cloud-in-2026.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 13:04:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/edge-computing-cuts-iiot-latency-by-87-why-manufacturers-move-data-off-cloud-in-2026</guid></item></channel></rss>